lity}>{capability}</span>)}</div>}<div className="architecture-detail-note"><strong>Aegis complements the security stack.</strong><span>Telemetry and detections can flow to SIEM and SOC; remediation remains controlled and allowlisted.</span></div></div><div className="architecture-explanations"><div><b>ENTERPRISE / IT</b><span>{tierDescriptions.enterprise}</span></div><div><b>DMZ / APPLICATION</b><span>{tierDescriptions.dmz}</span></div><div><b>INDUSTRIAL / OT</b><span>{tierDescriptions.ot}</span></div></div><div className="architecture-final"><span>DEVICE BEHAVIOR → DETECTION → TRUST ASSESSMENT → RESPONSE → RECOVERY VERIFICATION</span><strong>Aegis-Twin does not replace the industrial security stack. It adds a device-level trust and recovery layer to it.</strong></div></section>;
